    <string name="health_title">Health Connect steps</string>
    <string name="health_explanation">Optionally allow Luma to read step totals from Health Connect. Tap Import to refresh the last seven calendar dates, including today so far. Totals stay on this device and appear in Today, Timeline and saved summaries. Health Connect combines overlapping sources. Luma does not write health data or read sleep or workouts.</string>
