    <string name="health_privacy_title">How Luma uses steps</string>
    <string name="health_privacy_retention">Luma stores imported daily step totals in its private local database. It does not upload them, use telemetry, or enable automatic backup. Imports run only while the app is open. Turning imports off stops Luma reads and keeps saved history; manage Health Connect access to revoke permission. Successful imports reconcile corrections and removed data in the last seven dates. Older saved totals remain snapshots. Missing data is shown as unavailable, not zero. Clearing Luma’s app storage or uninstalling deletes these local copies without changing Health Connect data.</string>
